WEBVTT

00:06.423 --> 00:08.425
[theme music playing]

00:29.070 --> 00:30.155
[line ringing]

00:42.042 --> 00:46.963
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

00:47.046 --> 00:48.923
EPISODE 7

00:49.007 --> 00:51.009
[pleasant music playing]

01:16.534 --> 01:17.744
[girls laughing]

01:18.495 --> 01:19.954
Okay, let's go one more time.

01:20.038 --> 01:20.955
[girls laughing]

01:23.208 --> 01:24.667
[tires screeching]

01:33.593 --> 01:35.595
[somber music playing]

01:52.362 --> 01:53.363
[breath trembling]

01:57.200 --> 01:58.243
[young Hee-joo] In-a.

01:58.326 --> 02:00.120
- [sirens approaching]
- Yu-jin.

02:02.539 --> 02:03.540
[car door opens]

02:12.715 --> 02:15.135
[somber music playing]

02:15.218 --> 02:17.554
[whimpering] I'm here too.

02:18.179 --> 02:19.180
[Hee-joo] Speak up.

02:19.931 --> 02:22.183
[softly] Help.

02:22.267 --> 02:23.226
[Hee-joo] Louder!

02:28.690 --> 02:30.608
[crying] Help!

02:32.652 --> 02:33.778
[Yeon-hui] Shut your mouth!

02:33.862 --> 02:36.364
Your sister's gone deaf,
and your brother is dead.

02:36.948 --> 02:39.075
You can't sacrifice your voice?

02:39.659 --> 02:42.745
Not every life holds
the same value, Hee-joo.

02:42.829 --> 02:43.746
No.

02:44.372 --> 02:45.456
We…

02:46.499 --> 02:49.085
We can only stay
if the chairman feels sorry for us.

02:49.169 --> 02:50.461
Do you understand?

02:51.671 --> 02:53.673
[Hee-joo] No, tell her you don't want to.

03:00.972 --> 03:03.016
[music swells]

03:09.105 --> 03:09.939
No.

03:31.920 --> 03:33.004
[Sa-eon] Hong Hee-joo!

03:41.346 --> 03:42.513
Hong Hee-joo!

03:50.563 --> 03:51.731
[music fades]

03:55.902 --> 03:56.861
Hong Hee-joo!

03:57.695 --> 04:00.198
[Hee-joo] Paik Sa-eon?

04:00.281 --> 04:01.366
Hong Hee-joo!

04:02.033 --> 04:03.243
[breath trembling]

04:03.326 --> 04:05.328
[dramatic song playing]

04:07.205 --> 04:08.122
[Hee-joo] Right.

04:09.457 --> 04:11.167
There was you.

04:15.463 --> 04:18.424
When no one else cared about me,

04:18.508 --> 04:20.677
you noticed me.

04:22.512 --> 04:23.888
Whenever I was scared,

04:25.014 --> 04:27.100
you ran over to save me.

04:27.684 --> 04:28.893
[Sa-eon] Hong Hee-joo!

04:38.486 --> 04:40.738
[Hee-joo] Even when I said nothing,

04:41.489 --> 04:43.908
even when I didn't cry out for help,

04:45.034 --> 04:47.453
you were the only one who listened to me.

04:48.162 --> 04:49.247
[softly] Hong Hee-joo.

04:50.707 --> 04:51.624
I like you.

04:52.292 --> 04:53.459
[Hee-joo] But…

04:54.419 --> 04:56.629
why couldn't I bring myself to say it?

04:58.298 --> 05:01.050
That I feel the same…

05:20.737 --> 05:21.571
[Sa-eon] Hee-joo.

05:22.488 --> 05:23.573
Are you okay?

05:24.532 --> 05:25.366
Can you see me?

05:30.038 --> 05:32.123
[voice shaking] Wait, I'll get the doctor.

05:33.916 --> 05:34.959
[Hee-joo] Don't go.

05:43.176 --> 05:45.136
[soft music playing]

05:45.219 --> 05:46.054
[breath trembling]

05:47.138 --> 05:48.556
[softly] Don't go.

05:51.809 --> 05:52.727
[breath trembling]

05:57.231 --> 05:58.232
[Sa-eon] Okay.

06:00.818 --> 06:01.819
I won't go.

06:04.572 --> 06:06.032
[voice shaking] I won't go anywhere.

06:09.744 --> 06:10.620
[Sa-eon sniffles]

06:11.245 --> 06:12.163
Okay.

06:14.248 --> 06:15.249
It's okay.

06:18.211 --> 06:19.504
It's okay now.

06:25.051 --> 06:26.260
[music fades]

06:26.344 --> 06:28.262
- [Ui-yong] An accidental fall?
- [aide] Yes, sir.

06:28.346 --> 06:31.724
During their company retreat,
someone fell on a hike.

06:31.808 --> 06:32.642
Who was it?

06:32.725 --> 06:35.353
A new presidential
sign language interpreter.

06:35.436 --> 06:37.897
But security was tight,
so I couldn't find out.

06:37.980 --> 06:39.857
Why did they fall?

06:40.525 --> 06:41.567
Were they drunk?

06:42.151 --> 06:43.319
Were they drunk hiking?

06:44.070 --> 06:47.115
God… They're going to have
a field day with this.

06:47.782 --> 06:49.408
I don't think that was the case.

06:49.492 --> 06:53.621
This punk makes things worse
instead of helping me out.

06:54.455 --> 06:57.750
This is a sensitive time.
How could he let that happen?

06:58.543 --> 07:00.628
Excuse me, sir?

07:03.339 --> 07:05.424
Maybe it wasn't an accident.

07:05.508 --> 07:07.009
[ominous music playing]

07:09.428 --> 07:10.555
[flips phone shut]

07:15.935 --> 07:16.811
Keep going.

07:16.894 --> 07:19.439
Instead of the presidential spokesperson,

07:20.022 --> 07:22.775
how about focusing on him being your son
and making it look like

07:24.360 --> 07:26.070
[whispering] political…

07:26.154 --> 07:27.405
[music swells]

07:31.826 --> 07:32.827
Prepare the script.

07:36.706 --> 07:39.125
[door opens, closes]

07:41.169 --> 07:42.003
Right.

07:43.171 --> 07:45.173
Will I look good on camera?

07:49.594 --> 07:52.096
[Hee-joo] I ended up speaking.

07:57.894 --> 07:59.312
He knows everything anyway.

07:59.979 --> 08:02.315
[Sa-eon] 406! Listen to me carefully.

08:02.398 --> 08:05.526
I've put a first-aid kit
inside of Hee-joo's backpack.

08:05.610 --> 08:07.945
I hope Hee-joo finds it and uses it.

08:08.029 --> 08:09.780
What do you think, 406?

08:10.948 --> 08:12.575
[Hee-joo] He said 406,

08:13.242 --> 08:15.453
but it felt like he was saying it to me.

08:16.162 --> 08:20.249
He's not an idiot,
so there's no way he doesn't know.

08:23.294 --> 08:25.296
But why hasn't he said anything?

08:25.379 --> 08:27.632
[radiographer] Stand here,
place your hands on the sides,

08:27.715 --> 08:29.008
and put your chin here.

08:29.091 --> 08:31.385
[Hee-joo] Is it because
I'm still a patient?

08:32.053 --> 08:34.096
Then the moment I get discharged…

08:34.680 --> 08:36.724
[Sa-eon] Let's divorce, Hong Hee-joo. No…

08:37.308 --> 08:38.559
I mean, 406.

08:38.643 --> 08:41.979
Since you breached the contract,
cough up the two billion won.

08:43.481 --> 08:44.315
[Sa-eon scoffs]

08:45.358 --> 08:46.359
All this time,

08:47.652 --> 08:49.153
you sure fooled me.

08:50.112 --> 08:51.781
How dare you?

08:51.864 --> 08:52.865
[quirky music playing]

08:52.949 --> 08:55.826
Get out now.
I can't stand the sight of you.

09:02.708 --> 09:04.377
I said I liked you.

09:06.087 --> 09:06.921
I take it back.

09:07.588 --> 09:09.924
[radiographer] Miss, don't move.
I'm taking the X-ray now.

09:10.007 --> 09:12.301
[Hee-joo] Wait, where's the phone?

09:13.010 --> 09:15.304
- [gasps]
- [radiographer] I said not to move.

09:15.388 --> 09:17.098
There's no footage?

09:17.181 --> 09:20.643
[Do-jae] Yes, I checked the entire trail,
from the entrance to the summit,

09:20.726 --> 09:23.437
but there was no one
who could be identified as a suspect.

09:23.521 --> 09:25.982
And there were no cameras
where the accident occurred.

09:26.065 --> 09:26.899
Any witnesses?

09:27.608 --> 09:29.068
We're gathering statements,

09:29.151 --> 09:31.654
but the scene was so chaotic
and crowded that day.

09:33.155 --> 09:35.116
How's Ms. Hong Hee-joo now?

09:35.199 --> 09:37.201
She's being examined.

09:37.285 --> 09:39.370
For now, there are no major issues.

09:40.496 --> 09:41.497
What a relief.

09:42.665 --> 09:46.043
- The police are waiting for a statement…
- Don't tell them she's awake yet.

09:46.961 --> 09:48.963
I'll get her statement.

09:49.630 --> 09:52.008
Her identity
is being fully protected, right?

09:52.091 --> 09:52.925
Yes, sir.

09:54.302 --> 09:57.888
But why do you think
he went after Interpreter Hong Hee-joo?

09:57.972 --> 09:59.015
[solemn music playing]

09:59.098 --> 10:00.099
[Sa-eon inhales deeply]

10:00.182 --> 10:02.935
I'm sure they were after me
and missed their shot.

10:04.061 --> 10:06.606
What about the thing
I asked you to look into?

10:07.356 --> 10:08.190
I've checked it.

10:12.987 --> 10:14.405
Did you find anything?

10:14.488 --> 10:18.659
The malicious code we found on the phone
during the voice modulation analysis

10:18.743 --> 10:20.995
was actually planted
to facilitate hacking.

10:21.078 --> 10:22.580
- Hacking?
- [Do-jae] Yes.

10:22.663 --> 10:24.457
The program is called RCS,

10:24.540 --> 10:27.668
and it can control PCs or smartphones
to monitor users remotely

10:27.752 --> 10:28.961
and track their location.

10:30.630 --> 10:32.757
[Sa-eon] Is that how he followed us
to the summit?

10:32.840 --> 10:34.091
With the tracking device?

10:34.175 --> 10:36.969
But if we hack the code
and collect the data on the other side--

10:37.053 --> 10:38.971
Then we can track his location.

10:39.805 --> 10:40.931
How long will it take?

10:41.015 --> 10:42.975
At most, two to three days. I'll hurry.

10:43.934 --> 10:44.935
Great work.

10:47.563 --> 10:50.775
It's only a matter of time
before we find him.

10:59.659 --> 11:01.202
You can go now.

11:14.840 --> 11:15.841
[sighs deeply]

11:17.176 --> 11:19.095
Why are you being so tight-lipped now?

11:19.678 --> 11:21.430
You had no trouble speaking earlier.

11:24.475 --> 11:26.102
You'll stop talking again?

11:51.669 --> 11:52.586
I like it.

11:54.046 --> 11:56.048
I like feeling your heartbeat.

11:57.758 --> 11:59.760
[mellow music playing]

12:22.908 --> 12:23.742
It's okay.

12:25.369 --> 12:26.537
I already knew

12:27.496 --> 12:28.998
that you could talk.

12:30.040 --> 12:33.794
I know far more about you…

12:35.713 --> 12:36.630
than you think.

12:39.425 --> 12:40.342
406.

12:48.184 --> 12:49.935
He told me your location.

12:50.603 --> 12:52.521
He might've been the one who pushed you,

12:55.107 --> 12:56.609
but he helped me find you too.

13:00.321 --> 13:01.864
So I'm torn.

13:01.947 --> 13:03.115
406…

13:04.617 --> 13:06.994
Should I catch
and hand him over to the cops

13:09.038 --> 13:10.372
or just forgive him?

13:19.131 --> 13:21.050
- The truth is--
- [Sa-eon] Do you see that?

13:24.512 --> 13:25.387
ABSOLUTE REST

13:25.471 --> 13:27.848
What you need right now is rest.

13:27.932 --> 13:29.433
Absolute rest.

13:30.142 --> 13:33.604
I have many things I want to ask you,
things I'm curious about, but…

13:34.438 --> 13:35.606
I won't ask right now.

13:35.689 --> 13:36.774
So, for now,

13:37.691 --> 13:38.692
just rest.

13:39.318 --> 13:43.197
What about my work?

13:43.280 --> 13:44.949
You'll be on sick leave.

13:46.534 --> 13:47.535
So just…

13:48.452 --> 13:49.870
think about getting better.

13:52.623 --> 13:54.416
I'll be away for a few hours.

13:55.668 --> 13:57.753
Your old phone was smashed,

13:58.504 --> 13:59.547
so use this now.

14:00.297 --> 14:01.882
Call me if anything happens.

14:02.424 --> 14:03.259
Got it?

14:04.677 --> 14:07.888
- Answer me.
- [softly] Okay.

14:15.646 --> 14:16.647
I'll be back.

14:25.781 --> 14:26.699
[door closes]

14:27.616 --> 14:29.243
[mellow music continues playing]

14:40.504 --> 14:42.214
Did he not see it?

14:44.383 --> 14:45.467
I was…

14:46.635 --> 14:50.097
going to use this phone to escape you.

14:50.180 --> 14:52.224
You wanted Hong In-a from the start.

14:52.308 --> 14:55.769
Hong Hee-joo is just a stand-in puppet.

14:55.853 --> 14:58.898
It's not like you married her for love.
You don't even love her now.

15:01.901 --> 15:03.152
But this phone was

15:04.737 --> 15:07.114
the only thing that connected you and me.

15:07.197 --> 15:09.116
[Sa-eon] Hee-joo isn't
supplementary pages.

15:09.199 --> 15:10.910
She's a brand-new language.

15:10.993 --> 15:13.412
Does Hee-joo want sincerity,

15:13.495 --> 15:14.455
attention,

15:15.497 --> 15:16.332
understanding,

15:16.415 --> 15:17.416
and affection?

15:18.500 --> 15:19.710
Is that what she wants?

15:22.963 --> 15:25.549
[masseuse] You don't have
any neck wrinkles at all.

15:26.258 --> 15:28.010
I can see them, though.

15:28.928 --> 15:30.596
Try your best.

15:30.679 --> 15:34.141
I almost forgot. Your daughter's here.
Did you see her?

15:34.934 --> 15:37.269
What? Is she really here?

15:37.353 --> 15:39.521
[intriguing music playing]

15:41.231 --> 15:42.399
What's gotten into you?

15:42.483 --> 15:45.027
You never listened to me
when I told you to come.

15:45.569 --> 15:46.445
Right.

15:47.446 --> 15:50.282
There's something
I've been meaning to ask you.

15:52.201 --> 15:54.787
Sa-eon seems to care about you a lot.

15:55.537 --> 15:56.664
What's your secret?

15:57.247 --> 15:58.499
Was it that work outfit?

15:59.208 --> 16:00.334
Did that do the trick?

16:00.417 --> 16:01.752
[laughing]

16:03.504 --> 16:05.005
Get up, you brat.

16:05.589 --> 16:07.341
You should be thanking me.

16:07.424 --> 16:08.634
Do you get it now?

16:09.134 --> 16:10.719
A man needs a woman's touch--

16:10.803 --> 16:11.637
[gasps]

16:11.720 --> 16:13.305
What? You!

16:14.056 --> 16:16.058
- What are you doing here?
- It's been a while.

16:16.141 --> 16:17.184
[gasps]

16:17.267 --> 16:18.477
How have you been?

16:20.813 --> 16:22.022
[phone vibrating]

16:23.983 --> 16:25.067
PARK DO-JAE

16:25.985 --> 16:27.653
Yeah, I'm on my way.

16:27.736 --> 16:28.862
[Do-jae] It's not that.

16:28.946 --> 16:31.448
There's something
you have to check right now.

16:32.449 --> 16:33.701
What is it?

16:33.784 --> 16:35.661
UNCOVER THE TRUTH
WITH UNBIASED INVESTIGATION

16:35.744 --> 16:38.080
PRESS CONFERENCE
PRESIDENTIAL OFFICE RETREAT ATTACK

16:38.163 --> 16:39.498
[camera shutters clicking]

16:40.457 --> 16:41.458
[bangs table]

16:41.542 --> 16:42.710
[suspenseful music playing]

16:42.793 --> 16:45.921
I am truly devastated

16:46.547 --> 16:48.007
and at a loss for words.

16:48.966 --> 16:52.803
I am not only a presidential candidate
of this country

16:52.886 --> 16:57.391
but also a father to my beloved only son.

16:58.142 --> 16:59.476
Yes?

16:59.977 --> 17:01.145
So you're saying

17:01.228 --> 17:04.606
that you believe the fall
at the spokesperson's office retreat

17:04.690 --> 17:08.152
could be a "political terror"
rather than just an accidental stumble?

17:08.235 --> 17:09.445
Is that it?

17:09.528 --> 17:13.073
I want to believe it's not true,

17:13.157 --> 17:16.452
but how could this possibly be
just a random accident?

17:16.535 --> 17:20.497
But according to what's been reported,
nothing happened to the spokesperson…

17:20.581 --> 17:22.416
How fortunate is that?

17:23.584 --> 17:25.461
[reporters murmuring]

17:25.544 --> 17:28.088
Well, of course,

17:28.172 --> 17:30.799
I know it's a great tragedy
for the presidential office staff

17:30.883 --> 17:32.551
and their family

17:33.635 --> 17:35.679
who were affected by the accident,

17:36.513 --> 17:38.724
and I sincerely wish
for their swift recovery.

17:39.516 --> 17:40.350
However,

17:41.143 --> 17:44.897
to determine whether it was an attack
aimed at the spokesperson

17:45.606 --> 17:49.860
or an accident involving a staff member,

17:50.444 --> 17:56.075
I urge a thorough investigation
to get to the bottom of it.

17:57.743 --> 17:59.745
[gripping music playing]

18:03.123 --> 18:04.374
[telephone ringing]

18:04.458 --> 18:06.293
[Jin-hee] We are still investigating…

18:06.376 --> 18:07.836
This is the spokesperson's office.

18:07.920 --> 18:10.339
- As of now…
- [Do-jae] We're verifying the facts.

18:10.422 --> 18:11.924
Refrain from speculative reporting.

18:12.007 --> 18:16.261
[Young-woo] We're still investigating
whether it was an accidental fall or not.

18:16.345 --> 18:19.014
No, that's the position
of the presidential candidate.

18:19.098 --> 18:20.724
It has nothing to do with us…

18:23.352 --> 18:25.479
Someone got hurt. Does that really matter?

18:26.605 --> 18:28.732
It's a matter of life and death, you know?

18:30.234 --> 18:32.736
No, I'm not saying they died.

18:32.820 --> 18:34.488
- [line disconnects]
- [Young-woo] Hello?

18:35.155 --> 18:35.989
Hello--

18:39.409 --> 18:40.244
Sir?

18:41.870 --> 18:43.997
[gripping music continues playing]

18:44.081 --> 18:47.167
From now on, our office will only say
these three things.

18:47.251 --> 18:48.544
Repeat them like a parrot.

18:48.627 --> 18:51.421
One, we're verifying the facts.
Two, we're finalizing our stance.

18:51.505 --> 18:53.298
Three, the press release is tomorrow.

18:53.382 --> 18:54.508
Tomorrow?

18:54.591 --> 18:56.510
It's not today? It's not right now?

18:56.593 --> 19:00.264
Rash responses will only fuel
misunderstandings and speculation.

19:00.347 --> 19:04.184
We'll act with confirmed information,
which we will secure by the end of today.

19:06.186 --> 19:07.312
[employee] Then…

19:08.105 --> 19:09.481
what shall we do?

19:10.899 --> 19:14.736
Mr. Kang, ensure that
the victim's personal information

19:14.820 --> 19:16.280
is protected and not leaked.

19:16.363 --> 19:19.032
Send a confidentiality notice
to other departments.

19:19.700 --> 19:20.534
[Young-woo] Sir.

19:21.869 --> 19:23.495
I don't believe this.

19:24.746 --> 19:28.584
We haven't worked with her for long,
but Hong Hee-joo is our colleague.

19:29.209 --> 19:30.919
You don't explain anything.

19:31.003 --> 19:34.089
You just want us to hide it,
cover it up, and conceal it.

19:34.173 --> 19:37.050
We're worried about her too. That's right.

19:37.134 --> 19:40.971
Is she okay? Did she wake up?

19:41.805 --> 19:43.098
Is she eating well?

19:43.182 --> 19:45.434
[breath trembling, clicks tongue]

19:46.935 --> 19:48.145
She's safe.

19:49.479 --> 19:51.398
Fortunately, she wasn't hurt much.

19:52.232 --> 19:55.444
I'm sure you were all worried.
I'm sorry for causing concern.

19:57.446 --> 19:58.614
In the midst of it all,

19:58.697 --> 20:01.909
what's with
Candidate Paik Ui-yong's statement?

20:01.992 --> 20:03.118
Darn it.

20:03.827 --> 20:04.661
[sighs deeply]

20:04.745 --> 20:07.372
I'll address that soon as well.

20:09.791 --> 20:11.251
[Yeon-hui] When did you get back?

20:11.335 --> 20:14.171
When and how did you get the surgery,
and when did you start talking?

20:14.254 --> 20:15.756
What's the rush?

20:16.715 --> 20:19.259
Don't you care to know how I've been?

20:19.343 --> 20:21.762
Your father's probably curious about that.

20:21.845 --> 20:22.804
What are you up to?

20:24.890 --> 20:28.518
Don't worry. I'm not here to be
the future president's daughter-in-law.

20:28.602 --> 20:31.146
[chuckles softly]
You can't have it anyway.

20:31.813 --> 20:35.442
Hee-joo takes after me, after all.
You heard what I said earlier.

20:35.525 --> 20:39.529
She has Sa-eon wrapped around her finger
in three years of marriage.

20:40.489 --> 20:41.907
Do you really think so?

20:42.574 --> 20:44.993
Even after she finds out
the truth about him?

20:45.661 --> 20:46.495
What?

20:46.578 --> 20:48.956
[chuckles softly] I know you know.

20:49.915 --> 20:52.751
You're the one who kindly gave the hint
the day before the wedding.

20:53.335 --> 20:54.920
[suspenseful music playing]

20:55.003 --> 20:56.713
[door opens, closes]

20:59.758 --> 21:03.053
CHUNGWOON ART CENTER
TO CEO HONG IN-A

21:04.388 --> 21:06.098
CHUNGWOON ART CENTER CEO HONG IN-A

21:18.402 --> 21:20.153
[In-a] You sent that to me.

21:21.446 --> 21:23.198
To scare me into running away.

21:24.032 --> 21:25.409
What are you talking about?

21:26.034 --> 21:27.744
What did you get before the wedding?

21:30.038 --> 21:30.998
It wasn't you?

21:31.081 --> 21:32.958
Whatever it is, I don't care.

21:33.542 --> 21:35.627
It's in the past. Let's not bring it up.

21:36.336 --> 21:39.214
If you're not here to cause trouble,
keep a low profile.

21:39.756 --> 21:42.968
Don't provoke your father
right before the election.

21:43.552 --> 21:44.761
I'm not here

21:46.138 --> 21:48.807
to cause trouble but to help Hee-joo.

21:50.100 --> 21:54.354
It wouldn't matter if this was just
a business agreement to her, but…

21:55.522 --> 21:56.982
I don't think that's the case.

21:57.065 --> 21:57.983
So?

21:58.650 --> 22:00.068
Then she needs to know.

22:00.777 --> 22:02.529
What she decides after that is up to her.

22:02.612 --> 22:04.156
[chuckles]

22:04.239 --> 22:05.365
Help, my foot.

22:06.283 --> 22:08.493
What do you know about Paik Sa-eon?

22:10.120 --> 22:11.121
Tell me.

22:14.291 --> 22:15.751
What more do I need to know?

22:19.212 --> 22:20.797
Is there more?

22:23.258 --> 22:26.470
The public is showing sympathy
and support as we speak.

22:26.553 --> 22:29.056
As expected,
the supporters are rallying together.

22:29.973 --> 22:34.061
However, the spokesperson's stance
hasn't been clarified yet.

22:34.144 --> 22:36.313
Why don't you
align your positions with him?

22:37.272 --> 22:38.106
You're right.

22:39.691 --> 22:43.278
I thought I'd hear from him right away,
so why has it been so quiet?

22:44.279 --> 22:45.113
[door opens]

22:53.830 --> 22:54.748
[scoffs]

22:55.665 --> 22:57.667
You finally came, Mr. Spokesperson.

22:58.627 --> 23:01.421
How are you? Were you hurt?

23:03.840 --> 23:04.674
No.

23:05.884 --> 23:10.472
Thanks to my father's heartfelt tears
and concern.

23:14.142 --> 23:17.229
The mood's set, so just go with the flow,

23:17.979 --> 23:19.189
and don't go off track.

23:19.272 --> 23:21.650
You're the one who's going off track,
not me.

23:23.318 --> 23:26.530
Unless you want to be countered,
you should stop here.

23:26.613 --> 23:27.614
Countered?

23:28.615 --> 23:29.449
By who?

23:32.244 --> 23:33.120
You?

23:35.747 --> 23:37.374
This is my sincere advice.

23:38.250 --> 23:41.461
Don't stir this matter up any further.

23:43.755 --> 23:45.841
Hey, you ungrateful bastard!

23:47.801 --> 23:49.803
[somber music playing]

23:51.346 --> 23:53.431
Hey, Paik Sa-eon.

23:57.185 --> 23:58.645
Who gave you that name?

23:59.813 --> 24:02.149
"Paik Jang-ho's grandson,
Paik Ui-yong's son."

24:03.150 --> 24:04.985
Who gave you that title?

24:11.533 --> 24:14.411
[Kyu-jin] My son
doesn't eat that kind of food.

24:15.620 --> 24:16.621
Eat this.

24:18.748 --> 24:21.459
My son doesn't wear clothes like that.
Wear this.

24:21.543 --> 24:23.670
My son doesn't like those types of books.

24:23.753 --> 24:24.754
Read these.

24:29.092 --> 24:33.013
PAIK SA-EON

24:33.096 --> 24:35.098
[somber music continues playing]

24:50.071 --> 24:51.239
Did I ask for it?

24:51.907 --> 24:52.741
What?

24:54.868 --> 24:55.702
That name.

24:56.328 --> 24:57.579
That title!

25:00.457 --> 25:02.292
I didn't get it because I wanted it.

25:04.002 --> 25:06.004
Stop shoving it down my throat.

25:07.172 --> 25:09.257
I'm on the verge of throwing it all up.

25:14.179 --> 25:16.139
Who's the staff member that fell?

25:17.515 --> 25:18.767
Are they legit?

25:18.850 --> 25:21.436
Are you sure they're not a mole
planted by those who--

25:21.519 --> 25:23.313
- It was family.
- What?

25:24.648 --> 25:26.524
Who are you talking about?

25:27.943 --> 25:30.820
A new presidential
sign language interpreter.

25:31.488 --> 25:34.074
A sign language interpreter…

25:35.158 --> 25:36.159
That can't be.

25:36.993 --> 25:39.079
Unless you've lost your mind,

25:40.330 --> 25:42.082
you wouldn't hire her, right?

25:42.165 --> 25:43.166
What?

25:44.793 --> 25:48.880
Does it displease you that Hee-joo entered
the presidential office

25:49.923 --> 25:50.924
before you could?

25:57.013 --> 25:58.139
[laughing dryly]

26:04.604 --> 26:06.523
PAIK UI-YONG, A FATHER'S HEARTFELT TEARS

26:06.606 --> 26:07.816
[somber music fades]

26:08.441 --> 26:09.484
My goodness.

26:09.567 --> 26:11.486
So what's the spokesperson's stance?

26:12.112 --> 26:13.571
It hasn't been announced yet.

26:14.197 --> 26:17.033
I hear no one knows yet
who had the accident.

26:17.117 --> 26:18.201
No.

26:20.537 --> 26:23.123
By any chance, have you contacted Hee-joo?

26:25.250 --> 26:27.627
I texted her,
but she hasn't texted me back yet.

26:28.628 --> 26:29.963
Goodness.

26:30.046 --> 26:31.423
[quirky music playing]

26:35.010 --> 26:36.428
Be careful. You'll get hurt.

26:41.766 --> 26:42.600
Coming?

26:45.937 --> 26:46.938
[quirky music ends]

26:47.022 --> 26:50.275
The owner of the villa
listed in the land register

26:50.358 --> 26:52.569
is a person named Jeong Jin-seok.

26:54.195 --> 26:56.406
That's right.
I looked into that too in the past.

26:57.282 --> 26:58.742
- Did you meet him?
- No.

26:59.326 --> 27:01.661
He wasn't living at the listed address.

27:01.745 --> 27:04.789
I wouldn't hire a private investigator
just to find him.

27:05.623 --> 27:07.000
From our investigation,

27:07.083 --> 27:11.004
Jeong Jin-seok has overdue
property and real estate taxes.

27:11.087 --> 27:13.631
But the National Tax Service
wouldn't tolerate it.

27:13.715 --> 27:15.884
That's right. They're tracking him too.

27:16.468 --> 27:18.053
I told the tax authorities

27:18.136 --> 27:21.639
we were preparing a program related
to a unsolved child abduction case

27:21.723 --> 27:24.851
and that we needed to find
someone named Jeong Jin-seok,

27:24.934 --> 27:28.021
and they said they'd share the information
when they find him.

27:28.104 --> 27:30.648
Really? That's great.

27:30.732 --> 27:32.650
I think we'll make progress.

27:32.734 --> 27:33.610
[gasps]

27:34.361 --> 27:35.195
Mr. Han?

27:36.946 --> 27:38.615
Are you finally showing interest?

27:39.324 --> 27:41.117
Didn't you want to pull the plug?

27:41.201 --> 27:44.579
No, that's before I knew about the twins.

27:44.662 --> 27:45.789
[You-ri] Oh, right.

27:45.872 --> 27:48.833
Have you tried to ask around
about the orphanage friends?

27:49.459 --> 27:50.877
Does anyone know the twin?

27:51.586 --> 27:52.921
Yeah, I'm looking.

27:54.964 --> 27:56.508
[eerie music playing]

27:56.591 --> 27:57.717
[scribbling]

28:06.351 --> 28:08.186
[breathing heavily]

28:08.269 --> 28:09.229
[music ends]

28:13.441 --> 28:14.943
[Hee-joo] Was it him?

28:16.152 --> 28:17.821
How did he know to come there?

28:18.530 --> 28:19.864
[phone vibrates]

28:25.328 --> 28:28.039
[Sa-eon] I'm on my way.
Do you need anything?

28:28.123 --> 28:29.124
[Hee-joo] No.

28:31.042 --> 28:33.545
- [sighs softly]
- [Sa-eon] Anything you want to eat?

28:36.798 --> 28:38.800
[amusing music playing]

28:41.302 --> 28:42.804
[Hee-joo] Tteokbokki?

28:44.681 --> 28:45.682
[Sa-eon] Nothing spicy.

28:47.726 --> 28:49.269
[Hee-joo] Then, fried chicken?

28:51.688 --> 28:53.106
[Sa-eon] Nothing greasy.

28:53.857 --> 28:55.817
[Hee-joo] Then anything sweet.

28:57.736 --> 28:59.738
[Sa-eon] No, it'll raise your blood sugar.

29:00.947 --> 29:03.783
Why ask if you were going to say no
to everything?

29:06.119 --> 29:08.580
- Is he teasing me?
- [sirens wailing distantly]

29:15.587 --> 29:16.796
[phone vibrates]

29:24.679 --> 29:25.764
[car accelerating]

29:31.394 --> 29:33.438
HONG HEE-JOO
WHEN WILL YOU GET HERE?

29:47.660 --> 29:49.245
If you want something sweet,

29:49.871 --> 29:50.705
eat some fruits.

29:53.541 --> 29:54.501
But these…

29:56.211 --> 29:57.921
haven't been washed.

29:59.047 --> 30:02.091
Are you saying that to me?

30:03.051 --> 30:05.011
[amusing music playing]

30:19.567 --> 30:22.195
By the way, when did you go home?

30:23.822 --> 30:26.282
On my way here.
I had to get some of my stuff too.

30:26.366 --> 30:28.451
Why would you bring this?

30:29.577 --> 30:32.413
Family members need certain items
for hospital stays too.

30:32.497 --> 30:35.667
- Why are you only thinking about yourself?
- You'll sleep here?

30:39.337 --> 30:40.922
We've already slept together.

30:42.048 --> 30:42.882
Last night.

30:46.928 --> 30:48.513
[Hee-joo] Where did we sleep together?

30:49.180 --> 30:51.516
And where's he going to sleep tonight?

30:51.599 --> 30:52.892
Here?

30:54.435 --> 30:55.854
There?

30:55.937 --> 30:58.106
Wait, there?

30:58.982 --> 30:59.816
[gasps]

31:01.568 --> 31:02.902
Is he taking a shower?

31:04.696 --> 31:05.530
Why?

31:06.197 --> 31:08.408
No, no, no. He can shower.

31:09.409 --> 31:10.952
What am I thinking about?

31:14.372 --> 31:16.082
- Let's wash up.
- Excuse me?

31:19.836 --> 31:22.338
How's the water temperature?

31:24.048 --> 31:27.594
They always ask you that at the salon
when they wash your hair.

31:29.137 --> 31:30.263
Is it hot?

31:30.346 --> 31:31.848
It's okay.

31:45.778 --> 31:47.780
[pleasant music playing]

32:02.629 --> 32:03.463
[groans softly]

32:03.546 --> 32:05.548
Sorry.

32:05.632 --> 32:06.591
Hold on.

32:08.134 --> 32:10.261
- [groans softly]
- [Sa-eon] What? Hold on.

32:12.764 --> 32:13.765
[grunts softly]

32:20.772 --> 32:22.774
[pleasant music continues playing]

32:30.949 --> 32:32.909
What is it? Are you uncomfortable?

32:35.370 --> 32:36.371
No.

32:37.413 --> 32:38.498
It's awkward.

32:41.709 --> 32:42.877
What is?

32:46.339 --> 32:48.758
Why are you being so good to me?

32:49.842 --> 32:51.427
Am I being good to you?

32:52.011 --> 32:53.638
Don't most husbands

32:54.263 --> 32:56.391
do this for their wives?

33:08.611 --> 33:09.737
[sighs deeply]

33:12.699 --> 33:14.283
I felt regretful.

33:15.368 --> 33:17.787
I don't think I've done enough for you.

33:20.832 --> 33:21.666
All done.

33:25.420 --> 33:26.796
Now go to sleep.

33:27.463 --> 33:28.297
[sighs softly]

33:31.676 --> 33:33.386
[pleasant music continues playing]

33:53.698 --> 33:54.699
[sighs deeply]

33:57.952 --> 33:59.037
[water splashing]

33:59.120 --> 34:01.247
[heart beating]

34:07.462 --> 34:09.255
What's wrong with me?

34:10.089 --> 34:11.883
All my tests came back normal.

34:21.809 --> 34:22.810
[music ends]

34:22.894 --> 34:24.145
[clock ticking]

34:31.486 --> 34:33.654
[mellow music playing]

34:50.379 --> 34:51.714
[Hee-joo gasps inwardly]

34:51.798 --> 34:53.591
Wait, I'm not ready yet…

35:00.223 --> 35:01.599
[bed whirring]

35:05.895 --> 35:06.979
You weren't sleeping?

35:07.563 --> 35:09.190
[mellow music continues playing]

35:11.609 --> 35:12.443
Go to sleep.

35:26.666 --> 35:27.708
[Hee-joo] Will I…

35:29.335 --> 35:30.294
be able to sleep?

35:32.672 --> 35:33.673
[music fades]

35:40.346 --> 35:41.973
That's it, everyone.

35:42.056 --> 35:45.685
I concentrated as best as I could
to recall the details,

35:46.561 --> 35:48.604
and it looked something like this.

35:50.106 --> 35:52.984
Paradisers, please,
can I have your attention?

35:53.860 --> 35:57.488
We're receiving reports
from anyone who has information

35:58.197 --> 35:59.490
about this dragon ring.

36:23.639 --> 36:25.308
Where did he go?

36:30.605 --> 36:32.773
CALLS
PAIK SA-EON

36:32.857 --> 36:33.941
[line ringing]

36:36.819 --> 36:38.279
- [line disconnects]
- [phone vibrates]

36:41.532 --> 36:43.826
[Sa-eon] Go to sleep.
I'm waiting for a call.

36:43.910 --> 36:45.578
Waiting for a call?

36:47.914 --> 36:49.415
[clock ticking]

36:52.710 --> 36:54.128
[phone vibrating]

37:00.843 --> 37:02.678
Who knew the day would come

37:03.554 --> 37:05.723
when I'd be happy to get your call, 406?

37:05.806 --> 37:07.808
[Hee-joo] Were you waiting for my call?

37:09.727 --> 37:11.020
Why are you happy to get it?

37:11.646 --> 37:12.480
I don't know.

37:14.357 --> 37:15.524
Thanks to you,

37:16.317 --> 37:17.985
I could find Hee-joo.

37:18.694 --> 37:21.030
Aren't you curious as to how I knew

37:22.740 --> 37:23.866
to tell you?

37:25.701 --> 37:28.371
[in distorted voice] To tell the truth…

37:28.454 --> 37:29.747
To tell the truth,

37:30.498 --> 37:32.917
I know a lot about you, 406.

37:35.878 --> 37:37.296
What do you know?

37:37.380 --> 37:40.716
You're in your mid to late-twenties.

37:41.842 --> 37:42.677
A woman.

37:43.803 --> 37:44.971
How did you know?

37:46.055 --> 37:47.390
Are you pretty?

37:47.974 --> 37:50.184
[quirky music playing]

37:50.268 --> 37:54.855
Why does it matter if the person
threatening you is pretty or not?

37:54.939 --> 37:58.067
I just have a feeling you might be.

37:58.651 --> 37:59.568
[scoffs]

38:00.069 --> 38:01.237
Men.

38:01.320 --> 38:02.363
[chuckles softly]

38:03.572 --> 38:04.991
[Hee-joo] Did you just laugh?

38:06.659 --> 38:08.577
Yes, this is nice.

38:10.579 --> 38:11.831
What's nice about it?

38:11.914 --> 38:13.332
Talking to you

38:14.458 --> 38:16.961
on the phone like this,
just like we always do,

38:18.337 --> 38:20.423
makes it feel like nothing ever happened.

38:21.299 --> 38:23.718
It's peaceful and nice.

38:23.801 --> 38:25.261
It's peaceful?

38:25.344 --> 38:27.513
Hong Hee-joo was on the brink of death.

38:27.596 --> 38:29.640
What are you wearing right now?

38:30.474 --> 38:31.892
I can't see you for myself,

38:31.976 --> 38:33.519
so I want to imagine it.

38:33.602 --> 38:36.272
[Hee-joo] Why would you imagine me,
you lunatic?

38:37.064 --> 38:39.650
From what I imagine,

38:39.734 --> 38:42.528
you have a delicate frame
to match your voice

38:43.696 --> 38:46.282
and a fiery personality to go with it.

38:47.658 --> 38:49.035
Fiery? To go with what?

38:50.036 --> 38:51.954
Wait, my body?

38:52.538 --> 38:54.665
I won't go that far.

38:54.749 --> 38:58.586
Well, anyway, it's fun just imagining it.

39:00.129 --> 39:02.631
What are you doing right now?

39:02.715 --> 39:03.799
Are you…

39:04.967 --> 39:06.886
Are you flirting with me or something?

39:07.720 --> 39:09.972
You're a married man!

39:10.056 --> 39:11.223
[Sa-eon] Hee-joo…

39:11.849 --> 39:13.601
is probably asleep by now.

39:14.769 --> 39:15.936
[Hee-joo] You jerk.

39:16.020 --> 39:19.273
[Sa-eon] It seems like
you're not fully ready yet,

39:19.940 --> 39:21.859
so let's try to get closer later.

39:22.568 --> 39:24.195
I'd like to propose an offer.

39:24.278 --> 39:25.279
An offer?

39:26.364 --> 39:27.656
What offer?

39:27.740 --> 39:29.158
[Sa-eon] Join me.

39:32.328 --> 39:35.623
Let's catch the culprit together.

39:35.706 --> 39:37.708
[dramatic music playing]

39:40.378 --> 39:43.631
I know you're not in on it with him.

39:43.714 --> 39:45.424
He's the one who pushed Hee-joo.

39:46.092 --> 39:48.761
And you're the one
who told me where Hee-joo was.

39:49.387 --> 39:53.057
After Hee-joo fell
from the mountain that day…

39:54.225 --> 39:55.476
Hong Hee-joo!

39:56.185 --> 39:59.063
While I desperately searched everywhere
looking for her…

39:59.146 --> 40:00.856
Hong Hee-joo!

40:00.940 --> 40:02.024
I made a resolution.

40:02.691 --> 40:03.692
That I will…

40:06.278 --> 40:08.030
make him feel the pain I felt, no,

40:09.615 --> 40:11.200
the pain Hee-joo felt,

40:12.284 --> 40:13.744
a hundred times over.

40:14.745 --> 40:15.913
So starting now,

40:16.580 --> 40:18.499
tell me everything you know about him.

40:19.500 --> 40:21.502
Don't leave anything out.

40:25.256 --> 40:27.925
- [director] Hey.
- [You-ri] Wait, is this real?

40:28.008 --> 40:30.761
Is this press release
really from the spokesperson?

40:30.845 --> 40:32.054
Yeah, that's right.

40:32.138 --> 40:33.472
Now, everyone, stand by!

40:33.556 --> 40:35.683
- We're going live right away, okay?
- [You-ri] Okay.

40:37.351 --> 40:38.185
What…

40:38.811 --> 40:40.062
What's going on?

40:41.063 --> 40:42.314
This is unbelievable.

40:44.150 --> 40:47.278
[patient 1] Good grief.
It's like a soap opera. Right?

40:47.361 --> 40:50.364
[patient 2] I want to rip
that rotten bastard's mouth!

40:50.448 --> 40:52.533
[patient 3] I want to stab him
with a knife.

40:52.616 --> 40:56.328
Bastards who fool around
should be castrated with scissors!

40:56.412 --> 40:59.540
People like him
don't deserve to be treated as humans.

40:59.623 --> 41:01.208
How about that?

41:01.292 --> 41:02.835
Is he about to get caught?

41:02.918 --> 41:04.170
[patient 2] Goodness!

41:04.879 --> 41:06.505
[patient 1] What did she do wrong?

41:06.589 --> 41:08.716
[patient 4] They need to be taught
a lesson.

41:08.799 --> 41:10.759
- Honey!
- [Hee-joo] What are you…

41:11.343 --> 41:12.470
doing right now?

41:12.553 --> 41:15.055
You're a married man!

41:15.139 --> 41:16.557
Hee-joo…

41:17.349 --> 41:18.684
is probably asleep by now.

41:18.767 --> 41:20.227
[male actor on TV] Honey!

41:20.311 --> 41:21.896
[patient 4] Good grief!

41:22.938 --> 41:23.981
Goodness.

41:24.064 --> 41:26.901
Miss, this is mine.

41:29.153 --> 41:30.321
[You-ri] Hello, viewers.

41:30.404 --> 41:33.782
- [patient 2] What?
- We have breaking news that just came in.

41:33.866 --> 41:37.578
I'm sure you have heard the news
about the fall accident that occurred

41:37.661 --> 41:40.414
during the retreat
of the spokesperson's office.

41:40.498 --> 41:43.709
The presidential office
just issued an official statement,

41:43.792 --> 41:45.628
confirming that it was not an accident

41:45.711 --> 41:47.922
but a criminal incident.

41:48.005 --> 41:50.633
- [patient 1] Criminal?
- [You-ri] It's been revealed

41:50.716 --> 41:53.260
that the victim
was Spokesperson Paik Sa-eon.

41:53.344 --> 41:55.387
[You-ri] Spokesperson Paik
revealed to the police

41:55.471 --> 41:59.058
that he had been receiving threats
for two weeks, starting from June 1.

41:59.642 --> 42:02.811
He also reported that he believes
the recent fall incident

42:02.895 --> 42:05.314
was an attempt to cause him harm.

42:05.397 --> 42:09.485
But the spokesperson drew a clear line,
stating that he does not view the incident

42:09.568 --> 42:12.696
as a political attack against himself
or Paik Ui-yong,

42:12.780 --> 42:15.366
the presidential candidate
of the Liberty and Justice Party,

42:15.449 --> 42:18.035
and urged everyone
to refrain from unnecessary speculation.

42:18.118 --> 42:21.997
But due to the ongoing death threats
and his concern for his personal safety,

42:22.081 --> 42:23.916
he requested police protection,
investigation,

42:23.999 --> 42:26.627
and for the suspect's composite sketch
to be made public.

42:26.710 --> 42:27.836
Cue the sketch.

42:27.920 --> 42:31.924
Viewers, please take a careful look
at the screen we're showing you.

42:32.007 --> 42:34.510
This is the composite sketch
of the suspect identified

42:34.593 --> 42:38.222
in connection with the threats and bombing
targeting Spokesperson Paik.

42:38.847 --> 42:42.810
[Sa-eon] 406, starting now,
I want you to answer my questions.

42:42.893 --> 42:46.146
The most important question.
Did you see his face?

42:46.230 --> 42:48.107
I didn't see his face,

42:48.691 --> 42:50.985
but he had a distinct feature.

42:51.569 --> 42:54.822
The suspect is a man
in his early to mid-thirties,

42:54.905 --> 42:58.242
- around 185 cm tall, with a solid build.
- [patient 4] Early to mid-thirties!

42:58.325 --> 43:02.746
[You-ri] He is odd-eyed, and one eye
appears light brown in different lighting.

43:02.830 --> 43:04.832
Good. Anything else?

43:04.915 --> 43:07.960
There was a strange, fishy odor
coming from him,

43:08.043 --> 43:10.004
and he stuttered when he got excited.

43:10.087 --> 43:13.507
It seemed like
he had anger management issues.

43:13.591 --> 43:15.801
The suspect has a stutter,

43:15.884 --> 43:19.638
displays signs of anger management issues,

43:19.722 --> 43:22.516
and appears to possess skills in threats,

43:22.600 --> 43:25.728
hacking, homemade bomb-making, and arson.

43:29.690 --> 43:31.859
I'll ask one last question.

43:32.610 --> 43:33.777
Yes.

43:33.861 --> 43:36.655
Why didn't you report this sooner?

43:37.448 --> 43:39.658
I wanted to handle it quietly.

43:41.076 --> 43:42.578
In the end, I failed to.

43:44.038 --> 43:45.664
Do you have any suspect in mind?

43:46.540 --> 43:48.250
Someone with a grudge, perhaps?

43:50.711 --> 43:51.712
I don't know.

43:53.964 --> 43:55.466
I'm sure about one thing.

43:55.549 --> 43:57.635
Whoever it is, they know a lot about me.

43:57.718 --> 43:58.969
Like what?

43:59.803 --> 44:01.430
Where my personal office was

44:01.513 --> 44:04.016
and even the schedule
of the company retreat.

44:04.099 --> 44:05.434
They knew personal details

44:06.226 --> 44:07.603
that only family would know.

44:08.479 --> 44:11.899
I'm guessing that
someone is providing the information.

44:12.608 --> 44:14.443
[Hee-joo in distorted voice] He said "Us."

44:15.110 --> 44:16.612
- "Us"?
- Yeah.

44:17.279 --> 44:21.408
Sis, I like you.

44:21.492 --> 44:23.994
Because you have the same goal as us.

44:24.078 --> 44:26.038
He can't stand being ignored,

44:26.121 --> 44:28.207
gets agitated easily,
and can't control his anger.

44:28.290 --> 44:32.544
Isn't it strange that someone like him
could carefully plan things

44:33.253 --> 44:36.340
like hacking a car
and setting up a phone for threats?

44:36.423 --> 44:39.343
Are you saying there's an accomplice?

44:39.426 --> 44:40.260
Yes.

44:41.261 --> 44:42.471
I'm sure there's one.

44:44.640 --> 44:46.016
We need to catch him

44:46.892 --> 44:48.602
along with the other guy.

44:48.686 --> 44:50.979
[intense music playing]

44:54.149 --> 44:59.405
DEPARTMENT OF PSYCHIATRY
DIRECTOR JI SANG-WOO

45:05.244 --> 45:07.287
ODD-EYED WITH ONE EYE
APPEARING LIGHT BROWN

45:08.831 --> 45:10.582
ODD-EYED

45:13.001 --> 45:16.505
[You-ri on TV] The suspect is a man
in his early to mid-thirties,

45:16.588 --> 45:18.549
around 185 cm tall, with a solid build.

45:18.632 --> 45:23.137
He is odd-eyed, and one eye
appears light brown in different lighting.

45:23.220 --> 45:25.597
[dramatic music playing]

45:29.476 --> 45:32.855
FISHING SUPPLIES

45:33.772 --> 45:36.859
Hey! Is this what you meant
by going off track?

45:36.942 --> 45:39.278
You're trying to screw me over,
aren't you?

45:39.361 --> 45:41.530
So you should've just stayed quiet.

45:41.613 --> 45:46.410
If you hadn't tried to use the accident
for your own gain,

45:47.411 --> 45:50.664
I wouldn't have had to go up
against what you said, would I?

45:50.747 --> 45:53.125
How dare you talk back--

45:53.208 --> 45:54.585
Enough!

45:55.586 --> 45:56.420
[sighs]

45:59.715 --> 46:00.966
[Ui-yong sighs in exasperation]

46:03.635 --> 46:05.721
- [Ui-yong sighs]
- Why didn't you tell us?

46:05.804 --> 46:09.183
I wasn't the first person he attacked.

46:09.266 --> 46:10.184
It was Hee-joo.

46:11.768 --> 46:13.312
He knew she was my wife.

46:13.395 --> 46:14.521
[suspenseful music playing]

46:14.605 --> 46:16.231
No one but family knows that.

46:16.315 --> 46:17.149
So what?

46:18.400 --> 46:20.068
Are you saying you suspected us?

46:20.652 --> 46:23.572
[Kyu-jin] What do we gain
from threatening you?

46:23.655 --> 46:26.241
Everyone in the family
who knows about your marriage

46:26.325 --> 46:28.619
wouldn't benefit
from the truth being exposed.

46:28.702 --> 46:29.661
That includes us.

46:29.745 --> 46:31.330
[Ui-yong] Besides that,

46:31.413 --> 46:33.916
why would you bring her
to work with you at the office?

46:33.999 --> 46:35.125
I decided… [sighs]

46:36.084 --> 46:38.045
it was safest to keep Hee-joo

46:39.087 --> 46:41.215
by my side, right in front of me.

46:41.298 --> 46:42.299
[Ui-yong scoffs]

46:42.966 --> 46:45.594
I guess you really care about her.

46:45.677 --> 46:48.013
Was that the only thing he knew?

46:49.014 --> 46:50.140
The marriage?

46:52.017 --> 46:53.101
For now.

46:53.185 --> 46:55.938
I don't know how much he knows.

46:57.648 --> 46:58.857
Our family has…

47:00.067 --> 47:01.276
more than a few secrets.

47:05.489 --> 47:06.323
Chairman Hong.

47:07.991 --> 47:09.576
Do you think it's him?

47:10.160 --> 47:14.164
That skeptical old man could
have decided to support another candidate.

47:14.248 --> 47:16.583
Do you think he's plotting behind my back?

47:17.167 --> 47:18.252
- [sighs]
- [phone vibrates]

47:18.335 --> 47:20.212
[suspenseful music continues playing]

47:22.005 --> 47:22.881
[chuckles softly]

47:23.840 --> 47:25.509
Speak of the devil. He's calling.

47:26.009 --> 47:27.010
Want me to go ask?

47:27.594 --> 47:28.929
If he's plotting something?

47:35.644 --> 47:37.729
[newscaster on TV] Spokesperson Paik

47:37.813 --> 47:41.066
revealed that the recent fall accident
during the company retreat

47:41.149 --> 47:43.569
was a targeted crime against him.

47:43.652 --> 47:46.280
And the police have launched
a public investigation.

47:46.363 --> 47:48.156
Based on Paik's testimony,

47:48.240 --> 47:51.451
the police created and released
a composite sketch of the suspect.

47:51.535 --> 47:53.662
Let's go live to our reporter
for more details.

47:53.745 --> 47:57.457
[kidnapper] You're the one who pushed her,
but my face is exposed.

47:57.541 --> 47:58.875
[sinister music playing]

47:58.959 --> 48:01.712
Why did you try to kill Hong Hee-joo, huh?

48:01.795 --> 48:03.714
Isn't our goal Paik Sa-eon?

48:03.797 --> 48:05.966
[reporter] The police have released
a composite sketch.

48:06.049 --> 48:08.844
The suspect is a man
in his early to mid-thirties,

48:08.927 --> 48:10.971
around 185 cm tall, with a solid build.

48:11.054 --> 48:12.514
[breathing heavily]

48:13.098 --> 48:14.266
[phone vibrates]

48:15.892 --> 48:18.895
Police said the suspect made
threatening calls to Spokesperson Paik.

48:18.979 --> 48:21.481
HONG HEE-JOO DOESN'T SEEM
TO WANT TO GET DIVORCED.

48:23.734 --> 48:24.776
[kidnapper] So?

48:28.280 --> 48:31.116
I WANTED PAIK SA-EON TO FEEL

48:31.199 --> 48:35.245
WHAT IT'S LIKE TO LOSE
SOMETHING PRECIOUS TOO.

48:35.329 --> 48:37.122
[kidnapper] But Hong Hee-joo didn't die.

48:38.582 --> 48:40.125
What now?

48:40.208 --> 48:42.002
We're about to get screwed.

48:42.085 --> 48:43.503
No, I mean just me!

48:43.587 --> 48:45.589
[sinister music continues playing]

48:50.761 --> 48:52.346
FIRST, GET THE PHONE BACK.

48:52.429 --> 48:53.430
[scoffs]

48:57.768 --> 48:58.769
[music fades]

48:59.353 --> 49:01.438
[Il-gyeong] Why didn't you tell me?

49:01.521 --> 49:03.273
How could you not consult with me?

49:03.857 --> 49:04.775
At first,

49:05.901 --> 49:07.402
I suspected you too.

49:07.486 --> 49:10.364
What? Why would I do something like that?

49:10.447 --> 49:11.865
I couldn't be controlled,

49:12.407 --> 49:13.825
and you disapproved.

49:14.493 --> 49:16.620
Strangling me wouldn't be off the table

49:17.621 --> 49:19.331
if it meant you could control me.

49:19.915 --> 49:21.458
If you know so much,

49:23.126 --> 49:25.253
why did you act like an amateur today?

49:26.213 --> 49:30.217
Why would someone as skilled at media play
as you step into the spotlight?

49:30.801 --> 49:33.887
This issue concerns
both of our families anyway,

49:34.513 --> 49:35.639
so you had either me

49:36.556 --> 49:38.350
or your father to hide behind.

49:40.936 --> 49:42.104
You should rest.

49:42.187 --> 49:43.397
I'll get going.

49:47.567 --> 49:48.568
No.

49:50.404 --> 49:52.823
You wouldn't act
like an amateur overnight.

49:53.532 --> 49:56.034
The most common
yet the most reliable method.

49:57.911 --> 49:59.538
Cover an issue with another issue.

50:00.580 --> 50:03.458
You've got the world's attention
focused on you.

50:04.835 --> 50:07.003
What are you hiding behind you?

50:07.087 --> 50:09.089
[mysterious music playing]

50:23.478 --> 50:26.398
PAIK SA-EON CASE,
POLICE INVESTIGATION NOW A PUBLIC INQUIRY

50:31.653 --> 50:32.946
EVERYONE'S GOT DIRT ON THEM.

50:33.029 --> 50:34.322
HIS IMAGE IS RUINED!

50:34.406 --> 50:35.532
WHAT WAS HE BLACKMAILED FOR?

50:35.615 --> 50:36.783
WHY'S THE ARTICLE UNFINISHED?

50:41.788 --> 50:43.165
CALLS
PAIK SA-EON

50:45.459 --> 50:46.376
UNKNOWN CALLER

50:46.460 --> 50:47.794
[phone vibrating]

50:52.632 --> 50:53.467
[phone vibrates]

50:59.473 --> 51:02.100
[kidnapper] Sis, did you see the news?

51:02.184 --> 51:05.812
Was it you?
Did you tell him what I looked like?

51:05.896 --> 51:08.482
But it wasn't me.

51:09.107 --> 51:10.776
I didn't push you.

51:11.693 --> 51:12.652
Liar.

51:13.487 --> 51:15.197
[kidnapper] You probably don't believe me.

51:16.281 --> 51:18.074
Since you backed out,

51:18.992 --> 51:21.077
you should return my phone.

51:22.954 --> 51:24.706
I'm on my way. Open the door.

51:26.708 --> 51:28.710
[foreboding music playing]

51:30.670 --> 51:32.798
- [Hee-joo gasping]
- [door rattling]

51:32.881 --> 51:34.299
[Hee-joo breathing heavily]

51:34.382 --> 51:35.383
[whimpering]

51:37.677 --> 51:38.845
[door rattling]

51:49.064 --> 51:51.274
- [Sa-eon] Hong Hee-joo!
- [breathing heavily]

51:52.108 --> 51:53.026
[Sa-eon] Hee-joo!

51:57.823 --> 51:59.115
Hee-joo!

52:00.575 --> 52:01.910
[breath trembling]

52:05.247 --> 52:06.206
[whimpering]

52:06.289 --> 52:08.792
What's wrong? Did something happen?

52:08.875 --> 52:10.126
[breath trembling]

52:13.964 --> 52:15.131
[breathing heavily]

52:16.508 --> 52:17.342
Are you okay?

52:17.425 --> 52:18.677
[whimpering]

52:27.352 --> 52:28.562
[phone vibrating]

52:29.646 --> 52:31.356
HBC JANG HYEOK-JIN

52:32.858 --> 52:35.193
- What is it?
- [Hyeok-jin] Are you okay?

52:35.777 --> 52:38.113
The voice phishing call
you asked about before,

52:38.738 --> 52:39.698
is that him too?

52:40.657 --> 52:41.950
- Yeah.
- [Hyeok-jin] Hey!

52:42.033 --> 52:43.785
You should've told me sooner.

52:44.786 --> 52:45.662
[sighs wearily]

52:46.162 --> 52:47.914
I know you're nuts,

52:47.998 --> 52:50.792
but this is the first time
I've seen you act this crazy since then.

52:50.876 --> 52:51.835
"Since then"?

52:51.918 --> 52:53.753
[Hyeok-jin] In the conflict zone,

52:53.837 --> 52:54.921
bullets were pouring,

52:55.005 --> 52:56.840
and you ran with a mic and camera.

52:56.923 --> 52:59.342
Sa-eon, stop being so reckless. Okay?

52:59.426 --> 53:00.886
If I stop,

53:02.012 --> 53:03.263
there won't be a place to hide.

53:03.346 --> 53:04.639
What?

53:07.642 --> 53:09.019
There's nowhere to hide…

53:11.146 --> 53:12.439
except behind me.

53:13.398 --> 53:14.733
[door opens]

53:14.816 --> 53:16.484
[mellow music playing]

53:29.539 --> 53:30.665
How are you feeling?

53:35.712 --> 53:36.713
I'm okay.

53:38.798 --> 53:39.674
[sighs]

53:40.342 --> 53:41.551
What happened earlier?

53:43.178 --> 53:44.554
Did someone come?

53:45.931 --> 53:47.015
You look tired.

53:50.143 --> 53:52.103
Yeah, I am.

53:52.187 --> 53:54.064
So go to sleep now.

53:54.147 --> 53:55.774
So I can sleep too.

54:02.739 --> 54:04.324
Are you not scared?

54:05.450 --> 54:09.037
Why? Are you scared?
Do you want the light on?

54:12.499 --> 54:16.711
[Hee-joo] Everyone's talking about you,

54:17.921 --> 54:19.965
and they're gossiping about you.

54:21.257 --> 54:22.509
Aren't you scared?

54:24.094 --> 54:25.011
What about you?

54:26.721 --> 54:27.597
Are you scared?

54:27.681 --> 54:29.307
[mellow music continues playing]

54:56.710 --> 54:57.627
I'm…

54:59.587 --> 55:00.839
not scared.

55:03.216 --> 55:04.634
And I don't regret it.

55:07.595 --> 55:09.139
So you just…

55:10.974 --> 55:12.934
have good dreams.

55:13.018 --> 55:15.020
[mellow song playing]

56:17.957 --> 56:18.917
[door closes]

56:21.336 --> 56:22.337
[song ends]

56:29.636 --> 56:31.679
CALLS
PAIK SA-EON

56:31.763 --> 56:32.806
[line ringing]

56:38.853 --> 56:39.896
[Sa-eon] Hello?

56:39.979 --> 56:41.564
I saw the news.

56:43.983 --> 56:44.818
But…

56:46.069 --> 56:47.695
I'm curious about something.

56:47.779 --> 56:48.655
[Sa-eon] What is it?

56:49.239 --> 56:50.907
When are you going to catch me?

56:54.369 --> 56:56.746
I ended up helping him, after all.

56:57.413 --> 57:00.583
Whether it's punishment
or an investigation, it has to be done.

57:01.251 --> 57:04.754
[in distorted voice] Also,
when will you take this phone?

57:05.421 --> 57:08.174
It's important evidence.
Don't you need it?

57:08.258 --> 57:09.509
If I need it,

57:10.343 --> 57:11.636
will you give it to me?

57:12.262 --> 57:13.263
I guess so,

57:14.222 --> 57:15.390
to catch him.

57:16.057 --> 57:17.600
How will you give it to me?

57:18.184 --> 57:19.769
Will you…

57:20.645 --> 57:22.647
show yourself to me?

57:24.941 --> 57:26.234
[melancholy music playing]

57:27.402 --> 57:28.236
[Hee-joo] Yeah.

57:29.696 --> 57:30.530
Let's meet.

57:34.451 --> 57:36.411
I'll come to you now.

57:38.121 --> 57:39.497
With this phone.

57:48.173 --> 57:51.301
What expression will you make
when you see me?

57:52.969 --> 57:55.930
I was torn because it might
torture you even more, but…

57:58.516 --> 58:00.185
But that was an excuse.

58:01.811 --> 58:04.564
I was scared, and it was just an excuse

58:05.815 --> 58:08.860
to avoid the moment
I'd have to face you as 406.

58:11.654 --> 58:13.656
[melancholy music continues playing]

58:16.784 --> 58:17.785
However,

58:19.204 --> 58:21.039
I won't run away anymore.

58:22.415 --> 58:24.918
I won't let you struggle alone any longer.

58:40.266 --> 58:41.100
[sighs softly]

59:02.413 --> 59:04.415
[melancholy music continues playing]

59:13.383 --> 59:14.467
[line ringing]

59:19.514 --> 59:20.431
Where…

59:22.225 --> 59:23.351
are you right now?

59:23.977 --> 59:26.479
[Sa-eon] I have a place
where I want to meet you.

59:27.063 --> 59:28.064
Come there.

59:52.630 --> 59:53.548
[line ringing]

59:53.631 --> 59:54.966
[Sa-eon] Are you here?

59:55.049 --> 59:55.967
[Hee-joo] Yeah.

59:58.803 --> 01:00:00.513
Why here, though?

01:00:00.597 --> 01:00:02.640
[Sa-eon] Have you been here before?

01:00:03.391 --> 01:00:05.351
On the day this park first opened…

01:00:06.102 --> 01:00:07.061
[girls laughing]

01:00:07.687 --> 01:00:08.646
[tires screeching]

01:00:14.986 --> 01:00:16.946
[Hee-joo] After that,
the word "amusement park"

01:00:17.530 --> 01:00:19.449
became forbidden in our house.

01:00:20.116 --> 01:00:21.534
[Sa-eon] Come to the carousel.

01:00:22.327 --> 01:00:23.369
Let's meet there.

01:00:28.082 --> 01:00:30.501
[mellow music playing]

01:00:39.260 --> 01:00:40.887
Would you like to enter?

01:01:00.406 --> 01:01:02.784
[young Hee-joo] In-a,
there are so many horses.

01:01:03.910 --> 01:01:05.119
Look there!

01:01:05.203 --> 01:01:07.288
[mellow music continues playing]

01:01:44.784 --> 01:01:45.868
I don't see you.

01:01:46.619 --> 01:01:47.620
Where are you?

01:01:47.704 --> 01:01:49.497
[Sa-eon] I'm by the ice cream stand.

01:01:50.623 --> 01:01:52.333
[mellow music continues playing]

01:02:26.701 --> 01:02:27.744
[line ringing]

01:02:34.417 --> 01:02:35.668
Are you coming?

01:02:37.587 --> 01:02:39.464
I'm waiting for you.

01:02:39.547 --> 01:02:41.924
[Sa-eon] What do you see in front of you?

01:02:43.342 --> 01:02:44.677
In front of me?

01:02:56.189 --> 01:02:57.398
I came up.

01:02:57.482 --> 01:02:58.441
[music fades]

01:03:01.152 --> 01:03:02.779
But there's no one here.

01:03:03.362 --> 01:03:04.447
[Sa-eon] Just wait.

01:03:10.787 --> 01:03:13.456
What are you doing?

01:03:14.290 --> 01:03:15.666
[Sa-eon] I'm getting you to relax.

01:03:16.876 --> 01:03:19.504
I've been waiting for the moment
to meet you too.

01:03:20.671 --> 01:03:22.965
I don't want see you looking all stiff.

01:03:23.716 --> 01:03:24.926
Don't get your hopes up.

01:03:25.009 --> 01:03:28.429
You'll probably wish
you never saw me at all.

01:03:28.513 --> 01:03:30.056
[Sa-eon] I guess you're not confident.

01:03:30.640 --> 01:03:33.267
Are you confident
you won't be surprised to see me?

01:03:33.351 --> 01:03:34.894
I don't think so.

01:03:34.977 --> 01:03:36.979
You'll be shocked…

01:03:38.356 --> 01:03:39.857
and disappointed.

01:03:40.483 --> 01:03:42.068
So you might

01:03:42.819 --> 01:03:44.570
end up feeling lonely.

01:03:44.654 --> 01:03:45.822
[Sa-eon] Are you…

01:03:46.697 --> 01:03:48.366
worried about me right now?

01:03:48.449 --> 01:03:49.867
[slow music playing]

01:03:51.494 --> 01:03:52.411
No.

01:03:55.790 --> 01:03:57.166
I'm worried about myself.

01:03:58.084 --> 01:03:59.752
I'm worried about seeing you…

01:04:01.337 --> 01:04:02.255
like that.

01:04:03.381 --> 01:04:04.298
[Sa-eon] I swear,

01:04:05.508 --> 01:04:06.759
you don't listen.

01:04:07.802 --> 01:04:09.220
I'm sure I told you.

01:04:09.971 --> 01:04:13.558
Underestimating yourself is a bad habit.

01:04:15.351 --> 01:04:16.686
[footsteps approaching]

01:04:17.895 --> 01:04:18.729
How should I…

01:04:20.565 --> 01:04:22.483
fix that for you, Hong Hee-joo?

01:04:24.235 --> 01:04:25.736
[slow music continues playing]

01:04:46.841 --> 01:04:48.509
Thank you… [inhales deeply]

01:04:52.221 --> 01:04:54.223
for all your hard work, 406.

01:04:54.307 --> 01:04:55.141
You…

01:04:57.602 --> 01:04:58.936
knew everything?

01:05:00.313 --> 01:05:01.564
Since when? No…

01:05:03.941 --> 01:05:06.110
If you knew, why didn't you…

01:05:07.153 --> 01:05:08.154
Why didn't I what?

01:05:09.780 --> 01:05:11.365
[voice shaking] Why didn't you hate me?

01:05:13.159 --> 01:05:14.160
Tell me…

01:05:17.788 --> 01:05:18.706
Hong Hee-joo.

01:05:21.125 --> 01:05:23.002
Tell me how to hate you.

01:05:32.428 --> 01:05:34.847
Tell me how to not love you.

01:05:37.350 --> 01:05:38.351
[music ends]

01:05:45.066 --> 01:05:46.776
[gripping music playing]

01:06:22.603 --> 01:06:23.604
[music ends]

01:06:24.230 --> 01:06:26.232
[dramatic song playing]

01:07:33.716 --> 01:07:36.635
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

01:07:36.719 --> 01:07:39.305
[Hee-joo] It's just hard to believe.

01:07:39.388 --> 01:07:43.100
Us being completely ordinary
just like everyone else.

01:07:43.184 --> 01:07:46.479
[Sa-eon] Could you do the same
when you know everything about me?

01:07:47.521 --> 01:07:49.482
[kidnapper] I'm going to take it all.

01:07:49.565 --> 01:07:51.692
[Hyeok-jin] What grudge does he have
against you?

01:07:51.776 --> 01:07:53.277
What are you doing?

01:07:53.360 --> 01:07:55.738
Do you already know who the culprit is?

01:07:55.821 --> 01:07:58.574
What bothers me isn't the case, it's you.

01:07:58.657 --> 01:08:00.117
Don't hide anything from me.

01:08:00.951 --> 01:08:02.119
Show me everything.

01:08:03.037 --> 01:08:04.497
[coughing]

01:08:05.247 --> 01:08:06.749
[Hee-joo] This kind of happiness

01:08:07.750 --> 01:08:09.335
would never happen to me.

01:08:12.379 --> 01:08:14.381
Subtitle translation by: Sue Mounce
